  <Placemark>
    <name>Northern Horizon Arc (NHA)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Northern Horizon Arc (NHA)</b><br/>6-gleisig (2x Express, 2x Regional, 2x Güter-Transit), ETCS Level 3 Moving Block im relativen Bremswegabstand, 800m-Züge<br/>6.470 km, 12 Std. 16 Min., 13 Zwischenhalte plus zahlreiche Non-Stop-Bypass-Durchfahrten (u.a. Bend-East, Burns-Basin, Ely-West, Kingman-North, Flagstaff-South, Santa Fe-East, Colorado Springs Bypass, North Platte-Hub, Gary-Indiana Loop, Windsor-Gateway, Hamilton-Escarpment, Buffalo-Depew Bypass, Springfield-Mass Pike). Zeiten lokal (PT/MT/CT/ET). Größte Tunnel: Mount Hood (42 km), Black Canyon/Lake Mead (18 km), Raton Pass (52 km), Detroit River (7 km, unterseeisch nach Kanada). Teilt Surrey/Seattle-Tukwila/Portland-Salmon Creek mit PCMS und NCAMS, sowie Chicago-Joliet Mega-Hub und Boston-West Route 128 mit NCAMS.<br/><br/><b>Beispielfahrt (Stopliste):</b><br/>Surrey (Vancouver): ab 07:00<br/>Seattle-Tukwila Hub: an 07:20 / ab 07:22<br/>Portland-Salmon Creek: an 07:47 / ab 07:49<br/>Las Vegas-South Gateway: an 10:04 / ab 10:08<br/>Albuquerque-West Bypass: an 12:43 / ab 12:45<br/>Denver-Northeast Hub: an 14:05 / ab 14:09<br/>Omaha-West Gateway: an 16:39 / ab 16:41<br/>Des Moines-West Hub: an 17:06 / ab 17:08<br/>Chicago-Joliet Mega-Hub: an 18:03 / ab 18:07<br/>Detroit-Romulus Hub: an 19:52 / ab 19:55<br/>Niagara Falls-North Hub: an 20:43 / ab 20:45<br/>Rochester-South Hub: an 21:00 / ab 21:02<br/>Albany-West Hub: an 21:42 / ab 21:44<br/>Boston-West Route 128: an 22:16<br/><style>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background:#1e1e1e; color:#eee; } }</style>]]></description>
