  <Placemark>
    <name>PNW-MAE (Pacific Northwest &amp; Mid-Atlantic Express)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>PNW-MAE (Pacific Northwest &amp; Mid-Atlantic Express)</b><br/>6-gleisig (2x Express, 2x Regional, 2x Güter-Transit), ETCS Level 3 Moving Block, Halbstundentakt 24/7. Schwere 1.200m-Fracht-Maglevs nutzen separate periphere Terminals außerhalb der Passagierbahnhöfe.<br/>6.100 km, 11 Std. 46 Min., 13 Zwischenhalte plus zahlreiche Non-Stop-Bypass-Durchfahrten (Bellingham-North, Everett-East, Tacoma-Dome Bypass, Olympia-South Ring, Bend-East, Burns-Basin, Ely-West, Amarillo-East, Sayre-Plains, Shawnee-Loop, Fort Smith River-Viaduct, Little Rock-North Ring, Jackson-South Bypass, Knoxville-West Gate, Greensboro-East Loop, Petersburg-South Bypass, Williamsburg-East, Toms River-Bypass, Edison-Metropark Transit). Zeiten lokal (PT/MT/CT/ET). Größte Tunnel: Mount Hood (42 km), Black Canyon/Lake Mead (18 km), Great Smoky Mountains (78 km), Chesapeake Bay (34 km), Delaware Bay (22 km), Hudson River. Teilt Surrey/Seattle-Tukwila/Portland-Salmon Creek/Las Vegas-South/Albuquerque-West mit NHA und NYC Penn Deep mit NCAMS/NHA.<br/><br/><b>Beispielfahrt (Stopliste):</b><br/>Surrey (Vancouver): ab 07:00<br/>Seattle-Tukwila Hub: an 07:20 / ab 07:22<br/>Portland-Salmon Creek: an 07:47 / ab 07:49<br/>Las Vegas-South Gateway: an 10:04 / ab 10:08<br/>Albuquerque-West Bypass: an 12:43 / ab 12:45<br/>Oklahoma City-West Gate: an 15:15 / ab 15:17<br/>Conway-North: an 16:05 / ab 16:07<br/>West Memphis Hub: an 16:30 / ab 16:34<br/>Nashville-Briley East: an 17:12 / ab 17:16<br/>Pigeon-Mountain Portal: an 17:51 / ab 17:53<br/>Charlotte-NE Loop: an 18:25 / ab 18:29<br/>Richmond-North Gate: an 19:17 / ab 19:19<br/>West Ocean City: an 19:54 / ab 19:56<br/>Atlantic City-Egg Harbor: an 20:21 / ab 20:23<br/>New York City Penn Deep: an 20:46<br/><style>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background:#1e1e1e; color:#eee; } }</style>]]></description>
